        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Garth Richardson, son of Garth Richardson\n- Groups: Daughters of Mara, Jellyfish, The Garth Richardson\n- Albums: Daughters of Mara's first album, Best!\n- Songs: the covered song\n\nFacts:\n- The producer Garth Richardson worked for the group The Garth Richardson, which later evolved into another group.\n- The director of Daughters of Mara's first album is Garth Richardson's son.\n- Jellyfish's album Best! includes a live cover of a song by the group that evolved from The Garth Richardson.",
